--- !u!114 &114564597070016378
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1210144315949743}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 231c31a562fa0695a3ebd8fada9adc68, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  textSound: snd_txtsans
  fontName: sans
  greetMessage: '* heya.^10\n* how can i help\n  ya?'
  idleMessage: '* not really doing\n  anything else.'
  exitMessage: wink`* see ya later.
  buyGreet: whaddya \nwant?
  buySuccess: wink`thanks.
  buyReject: neutral`ya don't \nwant that?
  buyNoMoney: side`you don't \nhave the \nmoney.
  buyNoSpace: neutral`you're \ncarrying \ntoo much \nstuff.
  item1ID: 21
  item1price: 40
  item1ShortDesc: A BASH-type\nbat item.
  item2ID: 19
  item2price: 25
  item2ShortDesc: Safety first!
  item3ID: 22
  item3price: 15
  item3ShortDesc: Increases\nSPEED in and\nout of battles
  item4ID: 23
  item4price: 30
  item4ShortDesc: From a local\nburger joint
  sellPrompt:
  - neutral`* hey,^05 i'm trying to get rid of\n  stuff,^05 not get more.
  - wink`* maybe if we get back to the\n  underground,^05 we can see if my\n  brother wants anything.
  talkGreet: wink`i can tell \nyou about \nshopping \nstuff.
  topic1: About yourself
  topic1lines:
  - wink`* hey,^05 i don't think i asked\n  what your name was.
  - closed`* ...^10 kris,^05 huh.
  - neutral`* that's cool.
  - wink`* i'm sans.^10\n* sans the skeleton.
  - closed`* but you already knew that.
  - closed`* and because you already\n  knew that,^05 i'm gonna tell you\n  something that you <color=#FFFF00FF>don't know</color>.
  - closed`* ...
  - side`* actually wait a sec,^05 we only\n  just met like 20 minutes ago.
  - wink`* don't you know that friendship\n  takes time?
  - neutral`* besides,^05 don't you have\n  anything <color=#FFFF00FF>more important</color> to do?
  topic2: About shop
  topic2lines:
  - rolleye`* well,^05 i found a buncha\n  stuff when i fell,^05 and i don't\n  have any use for it.
  - wink`* so hey,^05 why not give it\n  to someone else?
  - neutral`* huh?^10\n* why aren't they free?
  - side`* i've gotta pay bills somehow.
  topic3: What's a BASH weapon
  topic3lines:
  - neutral`* oh yeah, that label on the\n  bats that i found.
  - side`* well,^05 some weapons behave\n  differently in battles,^05 and\n  have different names for their\n  types.
  - closed`* for example,^05 susie's stick\n  is a SLASH weapon,^05 and it does\n  the stuff that you already\n  know about.
  - rolleye`* and noelle's ring is an ICERING.^05\n* it doesn't hit very well,^05\n  but she can use her\n  MAGIC in battle.
  - neutral`* and the bat is a BASH weapon.
  - closed`* that basically means that it's\n  usually pretty strong,^05 but\n  aiming gradually speeds up.^05\n* might be harder to use.
  - wink`* of course,^05 you won't need it\n  if you're being nice to\n  everyone.
  topic4: Red capped kid
  topic4lines:
  - neutral`* so i was wandering around\n  that twoson town,^05 and some\n  weirdo came up to me and\n  asked where my red cap was.
  - rolleye`* then he tried to punch me\n  and showed me a ruler before\n  he ran off.
  - wink`* needless to say,^05 but that\n  was weird.
  - side`* oh,^05 right,^05 the red-capped\n  kid.
  - neutral`* i guess it's some kid that's\n  tryna save the world.
  - closed`* not unlike you in some aspects.
  sellGreet: "What would \nyou like \nto sell?"
  sellSuccess: "Thanks for \nthat!"
  sellReject: "Changed your \nmind?"
  sellDeny: "We are \nnot accepting \nthat."
  backgroundSprites:
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 606213c4c9f94114a9c6a2e5c5aafb7d, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 97fb81f7b7c08cb4295d9c13717d09be, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2f233603dd717ca45a45f9184395587d, type: 2}
